AUDITOR_RESIDUE_CALIBER_NOTE=R5 recorded 38 (26+12). The extra entry is scripts/build_release_artifacts.py <module> unresolved dynamic at builder_member; R5 declared only find_build_python for that same file. The gate asserts on kind+path, never on the total: _SURVIVING_RESIDUE_KINDS admits exactly dual_file_runtime and unresolved_dynamic_sink, _EXPLAINED_RESIDUE_PATHS already contains scripts/build_release_artifacts.py, and _ELIMINATED_RESIDUE_KINDS has zero hits. tests/test_legacy_residue_gate.py = 73 passed. The file is the release builder and does not enter the shipped artifact.
